  "instructions": [
    "Bring the vegetable broth to a boil in a large pot.",
    "Reduce the heat to a simmer and add the soy sauce, Korean chili flakes, garlic, and ginger.",
    "Poach the white asparagus in the simmering broth for 5 minutes, or until tender.",
    "Remove the asparagus from the pot with a slotted spoon and set aside.",
    "Add the sesame oil, tofu, salt, and black pepper to the pot and stir to combine.",
    "Simmer the mixture for an additional 2 minutes, or until the tofu is heated through.",
    "Stir in the chopped green onions.",
    "Serve the poached asparagus in bowls and spoon the tang sauce over the top.",
    "Garnish with additional green onions and serve immediately."
  ],
